window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A rogue with nowhere else to go, Wyatt's made it through to the next round of the notorious Alpha Games, a brutal competition where the fiercest wolf shifters compete to win a pack of their own. Not here to make friends, Wyatt has his eyes firmly on the prize, despite nobody wanting to see a rogue like him win.</p> <p>Naomi's got plans. Win a pack. Save her sister from an alpha who wants to make her pay for the death of his brother.</p> <p>None of those plans involve finding her fated mate, and they definitely don't include him turning out to be a dark and brooding rogue on a mission to get himself a place to call home.</p> <p>She shouldn't get distracted. Her sister's life is on the line. She needs to do whatever it takes to make sure she takes top spot.</p> <p>And yet...try as she might, she can't stay away.</p> <p>This book is a MF wolf shifter romance with a cinnamon roll gentle giant alpha, a born protector, and a man you don't want to mess with, who'll soon become your new favorite wolfish book boyfriend.</p>"; 
